    <string name="str_about_html"><![CDATA[<h2>Moria Firmware Extractor</h2><p>Advanced application for forensic firmware extraction, archive unpacking, image parsing, and hardware reverse engineering powered by native <b>moria</b> and <b>libarchive</b>.</p><hr/><b>Project License:</b> Apache 2.0<br/><b>Author:</b> Daniel Elias Diamon Vazquez<br/><b>GitHub:</b> <a href="https://github.com/Danielk10/moria-firmware-extractor">moria-firmware-extractor</a><br/><br/><b>Third-Party Libraries and Components:</b><br/>• <a href="https://github.com/nmatt0/moria">moria</a> by nmatt0 (Apache 2.0 / BSD)<br/>• <a href="https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive">libarchive</a> (BSD 2-Clause)<br/>• <b>bsdunzip</b> (BSD 2-Clause)<br/>• Compression runtimes: lz4, lzma, zlib, zstd, openssl crypto, xml2, acl.<br/>]]></string>
